  "description": "<p><em>Artefact (a pouch of strange teeth).</em> Fit a tooth in your mouth (it takes an hour) to gain its power, one of twenty the GM rolls: a breath weapon, a spell <strong>once per day</strong>, a resistance, and the like.</p><p><strong>Drawback:</strong> each tooth fitted costs one of yours, and the next use of its power makes you lose 1 Constitution (a drain).</p><p><strong>Destroyed:</strong> every tooth used.</p><p class=\"arn-note\">Monsters &amp; Treasure, Artefacts. Its save DC is 20 unless the entry says otherwise.</p>",
